muli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn9le16ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: So you start on February 8th, don't you?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Yes, I do. I'm so pumped up!<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: That's a Monday, isn't it?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Yes, I believe so.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: What I want you to do is to make some goals for this job. You should have made some by now.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: I start on February 8th, as you know.  In May, I will have worked there for three months and hopefully during that time, I will have been working closely with some of my talented colleagues. By then, I feel that I will have learned enough that my role will be increased beyond just assistant editing. I want to make an impact right out of the gate and certainly don't want to get off on the wrong foot.   I also have some bills that must be paid and a student loan that should be addressed.<br />", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn9le16ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: Well, you seem to be on the right track. You wanted to buy a car, didn't you?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: What I want is a used car.  In August, I will hopefully have saved enough money to buy one.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: That sounds like a plan, but you're not finished, are you?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Nope. I have a plethora of ideas.  It should be mentioned that I received another text from Boris today.\nWhat he wanted was to tell me about another editorial assistant job. They are looking for another editorial assistant and they thought I might know someone. The job starts the week after mine does.<br />", "id": 2, "time": "51000", "image": "engenn9le16ob11re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: You are going to ask Adam, aren't you?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Good idea! I'll text him right now!<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: Are you sure? What worries me is that you are new and if Adam doesn't do a good job, it may reflect badly on you.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Oh, he'll be fine. It's an ideal job for him. Don't worry!<br />", "id": 3, "time": "92000", "image": "engenn9le16ob11re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le16ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le16ob11re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}